(text "E20 -96-channel constant-current LED/display driver. MCU->U1->U2->U3->U4; global n uses chip n/24 and OUT(n%24)." (at 20 18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 5c1f49f9-fb56-5458-be1f-6442e21715bb))
(text "5V powers driver logic and common anodes; dual-supply translator isolates processor3.3V. Both rails must qualify before outputs enable." (at 20 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 2aca59d1-beeb-5073-aff3-81f845f08e20))
(text "Proposed91x27mm PCB at(197,77), seat6.5mm beneath scene controls; exact footprints/PCB/fit remain to be verified." (at 20 840 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 5134b3fe-278e-584b-a3c7-ae30824a9d50))
(text "3mA is nominal, not a guaranteed low-current bound. E14/E17 digital power budget must include driver ICC. No fabrication or physical validation approval." (at 20 850 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 355158fd-8d36-5493-8e33-ce17c6e7342e))
